-- A TYPICALLY on a payload field of an enum constructor pre-fills that
-- field's follow-up question, as a record field's does (Lane C L7, ruled by
-- Meng 2026-10-12). The default is the radius question's `default: 1`, and the
-- DA-TYPICALLY note lists the field.

DECLARE Shape IS ONE OF
  Circle HAS radius IS A NUMBER TYPICALLY 1
  Dot

@export the area of a shape
GIVEN s IS A Shape
GIVETH A NUMBER
`area of` s MEANS
  CONSIDER s
    WHEN Circle r THEN r TIMES r TIMES 3
    WHEN Dot THEN 0
